---
import RoleTicker from './RoleTicker.astro';
import BrandArc from './BrandArc.astro';
---

<section class="professionals">
  <div class="container professionals__text" data-reveal>
    <h2 data-reveal-heading>Industry Professionals</h2>
    <p>
      At the heart of every successful network operation are the dedicated professionals who
      bring expertise, precision, and innovation to their roles. From design and construction to
      maintenance and oversight, these specialists ensure the seamless function and evolution of
      critical infrastructure.
    </p>
    <p>
      CHIME is built on the collective experience of these industry experts, offering solutions
      to those shaping the future of network operations.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="professionals__ticker-band">
    <BrandArc size={480} anchor="bottom-left" style="bottom: -140px; left: -140px;" />
    <RoleTicker />
  </div>

  <div class="container professionals__clear-horizon" data-reveal>
    <span class="professionals__clear-horizon-label">Clear Horizon</span>
    <p>
      Our team specialises in the business of regulated network operators. We have consultants
      with over 20 years industry experience combined with highly skilled business analysts,
      solution design and secure enterprise IT service architecture. Our reputation at the most
      senior levels in the industry is built on the strength of our exceptional team.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .professionals {
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .professionals__text {
    max-width: 48rem;
    padding-block: 7rem 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .professionals__text h2 {
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .professionals__text p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  .professionals__ticker-band {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #e8f6fb, var(--color-grey-100) 60%);
    padding-block: 2.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .professionals__clear-horizon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding-block: 4.5rem;
  }

  .professionals__clear-horizon-label {
    flex: 0 0 13.75rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  .professionals__clear-horizon p {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .professionals__clear-horizon {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
